{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type GenericInterruptResolution<TDefinition> = TDefinition extends AnyInterruptDefinition ? \n  | {\n  request: GenericInterruptRequest<TDefinition>;\n  response: InterruptResponse<TDefinition>;\n  status: \"resolved\";\n}\n  | {\n  request: GenericInterruptRequest<TDefinition>;\n  response?: never;\n  status: \"cancelled\";\n} : never;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L123","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:123"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdefinition","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TDefinition"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TDefinition"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AnyInterruptDefinition"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdefinition","text":"TDefinition","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype GenericInterruptResolution<TDefinition> = TDefinition extends AnyInterruptDefinition ? \n  | {\n  request: GenericInterruptRequest<TDefinition>;\n  response: InterruptResponse<TDefinition>;\n  status: \"resolved\";\n}\n  | {\n  request: GenericInterruptRequest<TDefinition>;\n  response?: never;\n  status: \"cancelled\";\n} : never;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:123](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L123)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TDefinition\n\n`TDefinition` *extends* `AnyInterruptDefinition`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: GenericInterruptResolution\ntitle: GenericInterruptResolution\n---\n\n```ts\ntype GenericInterruptResolution<TDefinition> = TDefinition extends AnyInterruptDefinition ? \n  | {\n  request: GenericInterruptRequest<TDefinition>;\n  response: InterruptResponse<TDefinition>;\n  status: \"resolved\";\n}\n  | {\n  request: GenericInterruptRequest<TDefinition>;\n  response?: never;\n  status: \"cancelled\";\n} : never;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:123](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L123)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TDefinition\n\n`TDefinition` *extends* `AnyInterruptDefinition`\n"}
